  "reason": "The existing evidence shows that multimodal multiprofile setups with imagenet_vit_l image encoder and avgpool aggregation achieve high validation accuracy (e.g., config_025: 0.6352). This experiment tests whether switching the RNA encoder from pca_n2000 to scvi_n200 (a different encoder type) while keeping the high-performing image encoder and aggregation method could further improve performance. This clarifies the importance of RNA encoder choice, a key design decision, without discarding the proven effective components."
